		<elementInformation name="description" show="1">Kinco KS105 compact PLC, 8 digital inputs and 8 transistor outputs, RS232 and RS485 ports and one CAN port. Terminal names are the markings of the unit; the I/O table lists the channels. Check the pinout against the datasheet of your unit.</elementInformation>
